Subject: Drugs

  One of the points I want to stress is that with the current state of
the drug market, there's no way you can really know what you are
getting when you take any of this stuff. Perhaps in some rich
communities there are "reliable" underground chemists dealing with
this stuff. My drug experiences were in high school and college and
with the exception of the X, there was no way to know where any of
this stuff came from. The X was made locally (or so we believed) and
the quality varied from batch to batch.
  I'm sure that at least two batches of stuff that we got as LSD was
NOT. I suspect that one batch of marijuana we got was dosed with PCP
and another with Mescaline. We got cocaine that was mainly dental
anesthetic and we got something once that looked and smelled like rat
poison which I refused to touch. The only drug that I had any sort of
confidence in was mushrooms, which I never actually took, because they
LOOK like mushrooms, but there are probably folks out there selling
ordinary mushrooms sprayed with LSD and calling them "magic."
   If you're interested in prolonging the quality of your mental
function for as long as possible, taking psychoactive chemicals of
unknown quality, nature, and strength is a gamble with high stakes.



